# GameDayOps College — production Supabase target (baked in for reliability).
#
# Both values point the College build at the correct Supabase project (the one
# holding the multi-tenant schema, auth, and the bootstrap_org function), so the
# app works regardless of Vercel env-var state.
#
# SECURITY: the "publishable" (anon) key below is designed to be public — it is
# RLS-protected and ships in the client bundle anyway. It is NOT a secret. The
# sb_secret_ / service_role key must NEVER be committed or put in the client.
#
# NOTE ON PRECEDENCE: a Vercel Environment Variable of the same name OVERRIDES
# this file at build time. So if login ever misbehaves, delete VITE_SUPABASE_URL
# and VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY from the Vercel project so these baked values win.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://wwpwjfrywzmmbjintgp.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_qKpmqm7qIlratWs8LcxSsw_wTri8EbK
